{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45371","headline":"步虚词 · 皎然","name":"步虚词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"予因览真诀，遂感西城君。\n玉笙下青冥，人间未曾闻。\n日华链精魄，皎皎无垢氛。\n谓我有僊骨，且令饵氤氲。\n俯仰媿灵颜，愿随鸾鹄羣。\n俄然动风驭，缥渺归青云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45371.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45371","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}